    {
      "s": "Si j'essaie d'endormir mes captifs en utilisant la méthode Ferber, que dois-je faire ? ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "793653_1",
      "n": "Q"
    },
    {
      "s": "Ugh, I am so behind on sleep. Some of my captives keep getting upset in the middle of the night. It’s exhausting.",
